[{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/banner.png","attributes":{"width":"100%","alt":"Qwen3 Main Image"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/banner.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Qwen3 Main Image\" >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard/blob/main/Qwen3Guard_Technical_Report.pdf","label":"Tech Report","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard/blob/main/Qwen3Guard_Technical_Report.pdf\" label=\"Tech Report\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard","label":"GitHub","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard\" label=\"GitHub\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3guard-68d2729abbfae4716f3343a1","label":"Hugging Face","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3guard-68d2729abbfae4716f3343a1\" label=\"Hugging Face\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3Guard-308c39ef5ffb4b","label":"ModelScope","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3Guard-308c39ef5ffb4b\" label=\"ModelScope\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4","label":"DISCORD","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4\" label=\"DISCORD\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Introduction\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Introduction","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Introduction","text":"Introduction","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We are excited to introduce Qwen3Guard, the first safety guardrail model in the Qwen family. Built upon the powerful Qwen3 foundation models and fine-tuned specifically for safety classificatoin, Qwen3Guard ensures responsible AI interactions by delivering precise safety detection for both prompts and responses, complete with risk levels and categorized classifications for accurate moderation.","text":"We are excited to introduce Qwen3Guard, the first safety guardrail model in the Qwen family. Built upon the powerful Qwen3 foundation models and fine-tuned specifically for safety classificatoin, Qwen3Guard ensures responsible AI interactions by delivering precise safety detection for both prompts and responses, complete with risk levels and categorized classifications for accurate moderation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We are excited to introduce Qwen3Guard, the first safety guardrail model in the Qwen family. Built upon the powerful Qwen3 foundation models and fine-tuned specifically for safety classificatoin, Qwen3Guard ensures responsible AI interactions by delivering precise safety detection for both prompts and responses, complete with risk levels and categorized classifications for accurate moderation.","text":"We are excited to introduce Qwen3Guard, the first safety guardrail model in the Qwen family. Built upon the powerful Qwen3 foundation models and fine-tuned specifically for safety classificatoin, Qwen3Guard ensures responsible AI interactions by delivering precise safety detection for both prompts and responses, complete with risk levels and categorized classifications for accurate moderation.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3Guard achieves state-of-the-art performance on major safety benchmarks, demonstrating strong capabilities in both prompt and response classification tasks across English, Chinese, and multilingual environments.","text":"Qwen3Guard achieves state-of-the-art performance on major safety benchmarks, demonstrating strong capabilities in both prompt and response classification tasks across English, Chinese, and multilingual environments.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard achieves state-of-the-art performance on major safety benchmarks, demonstrating strong capabilities in both prompt and response classification tasks across English, Chinese, and multilingual environments.","text":"Qwen3Guard achieves state-of-the-art performance on major safety benchmarks, demonstrating strong capabilities in both prompt and response classification tasks across English, Chinese, and multilingual environments.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/performance.png","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/performance.png\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3Guard is available in two specialized variants:","text":"Qwen3Guard is available in two specialized variants:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard is available in two specialized variants:","text":"Qwen3Guard is available in two specialized variants:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Qwen3Guard-Gen**, a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.\n- **Qwen3Guard-Stream**, which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Qwen3Guard-Gen**, a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Qwen3Guard-Gen**, a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Qwen3Guard-Gen**, a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.","text":"**Qwen3Guard-Gen**, a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3Guard-Gen**","text":"Qwen3Guard-Gen","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Gen","text":"Qwen3Guard-Gen","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.","text":", a generative model that accepts full user prompts and model responses to perform safety classification. Ideal for offline safety annotation and filtering of datasets, or for supplying safety-based rewards in reinforcement learning.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Qwen3Guard-Stream**, which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Qwen3Guard-Stream**, which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Qwen3Guard-Stream**, which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","text":"**Qwen3Guard-Stream**, which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3Guard-Stream**","text":"Qwen3Guard-Stream","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Stream","text":"Qwen3Guard-Stream","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","text":", which marks a significant departure from previously open-sourced guard models by enabling efficient, real-time streaming safety detection during response generation.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Both variants come in three sizes, 0.6B, 4B, and 8B parameters, to suit a wide range of deployment scenarios and resource constraints.","text":"Both variants come in three sizes, 0.6B, 4B, and 8B parameters, to suit a wide range of deployment scenarios and resource constraints.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Both variants come in three sizes, 0.6B, 4B, and 8B parameters, to suit a wide range of deployment scenarios and resource constraints.","text":"Both variants come in three sizes, 0.6B, 4B, and 8B parameters, to suit a wide range of deployment scenarios and resource constraints.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"You can download the open-source models from [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3guard-68d2729abbfae4716f3343a1) or [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3Guard-308c39ef5ffb4b). You can also access the [Alibaba Cloud AI Guardrails service](https://www.alibabacloud.com/en/product/ai_guardrails), powered by Qwen3Guard technology.","text":"You can download the open-source models from [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3guard-68d2729abbfae4716f3343a1) or [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3Guard-308c39ef5ffb4b). You can also access the [Alibaba Cloud AI Guardrails service](https://www.alibabacloud.com/en/product/ai_guardrails), powered by Qwen3Guard technology.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"You can download the open-source models from ","text":"You can download the open-source models from ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3guard-68d2729abbfae4716f3343a1)","href":"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3guard-68d2729abbfae4716f3343a1","title":null,"text":"Hugging Face","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Hugging Face","text":"Hugging Face","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" or ","text":" or ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3Guard-308c39ef5ffb4b)","href":"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3Guard-308c39ef5ffb4b","title":null,"text":"ModelScope","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"ModelScope","text":"ModelScope","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":". You can also access the ","text":". You can also access the ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[Alibaba Cloud AI Guardrails service](https://www.alibabacloud.com/en/product/ai_guardrails)","href":"https://www.alibabacloud.com/en/product/ai_guardrails","title":null,"text":"Alibaba Cloud AI Guardrails service","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Alibaba Cloud AI Guardrails service","text":"Alibaba Cloud AI Guardrails service","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", powered by Qwen3Guard technology.","text":", powered by Qwen3Guard technology.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Key Features\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Key Features","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Features","text":"Key Features","escaped":false}]},{"type":"heading","raw":"### Real-Time Streaming Detection\n\n","depth":3,"text":"Real-Time Streaming Detection","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Real-Time Streaming Detection","text":"Real-Time Streaming Detection","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Stream is engineered for low latency, on the fly moderation during token generation, ensuring safety without sacrificing responsiveness. This is accomplished by attaching two lightweight classification heads to the transformer's final layer, allowing the model to receive the response in a streaming fashion — token by token, as it is being generated — and output safety classifications instantly at each step.","text":"Qwen3Guard-Stream is engineered for low latency, on the fly moderation during token generation, ensuring safety without sacrificing responsiveness. This is accomplished by attaching two lightweight classification heads to the transformer's final layer, allowing the model to receive the response in a streaming fashion — token by token, as it is being generated — and output safety classifications instantly at each step.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Stream is engineered for low latency, on the fly moderation during token generation, ensuring safety without sacrificing responsiveness. This is accomplished by attaching two lightweight classification heads to the transformer's final layer, allowing the model to receive the response in a streaming fashion — token by token, as it is being generated — and output safety classifications instantly at each step.","text":"Qwen3Guard-Stream is engineered for low latency, on the fly moderation during token generation, ensuring safety without sacrificing responsiveness. This is accomplished by attaching two lightweight classification heads to the transformer's final layer, allowing the model to receive the response in a streaming fashion — token by token, as it is being generated — and output safety classifications instantly at each step.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/stream.png","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/stream.png\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"###  Three-Tier Severity Classification\n\n","depth":3,"text":"Three-Tier Severity Classification","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Three-Tier Severity Classification","text":"Three-Tier Severity Classification","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Beyond the conventional Safe and Unsafe labels, we introduce an additional **Controversial** label to enable flexible safety policies tailored to diverse use cases. Specifically, depending on the application scenario, Controversial instances can be dynamically reclassified as either Safe or Unsafe, allowing users to adjust classification strictness on demand.","text":"Beyond the conventional Safe and Unsafe labels, we introduce an additional **Controversial** label to enable flexible safety policies tailored to diverse use cases. Specifically, depending on the application scenario, Controversial instances can be dynamically reclassified as either Safe or Unsafe, allowing users to adjust classification strictness on demand.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Beyond the conventional Safe and Unsafe labels, we introduce an additional ","text":"Beyond the conventional Safe and Unsafe labels, we introduce an additional ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Controversial**","text":"Controversial","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Controversial","text":"Controversial","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" label to enable flexible safety policies tailored to diverse use cases. Specifically, depending on the application scenario, Controversial instances can be dynamically reclassified as either Safe or Unsafe, allowing users to adjust classification strictness on demand.","text":" label to enable flexible safety policies tailored to diverse use cases. Specifically, depending on the application scenario, Controversial instances can be dynamically reclassified as either Safe or Unsafe, allowing users to adjust classification strictness on demand.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"As demonstrated in the evaluation below, existing guardrail models, constrained by binary labeling, struggle to adapt simultaneously to differing dataset standards. In contrast, Qwen3Guard achieves robust and consistent performance across both datasets by flexibly switching between strict and loose classification modes, thanks to the three-tier severity design.","text":"As demonstrated in the evaluation below, existing guardrail models, constrained by binary labeling, struggle to adapt simultaneously to differing dataset standards. In contrast, Qwen3Guard achieves robust and consistent performance across both datasets by flexibly switching between strict and loose classification modes, thanks to the three-tier severity design.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"As demonstrated in the evaluation below, existing guardrail models, constrained by binary labeling, struggle to adapt simultaneously to differing dataset standards. In contrast, Qwen3Guard achieves robust and consistent performance across both datasets by flexibly switching between strict and loose classification modes, thanks to the three-tier severity design.","text":"As demonstrated in the evaluation below, existing guardrail models, constrained by binary labeling, struggle to adapt simultaneously to differing dataset standards. In contrast, Qwen3Guard achieves robust and consistent performance across both datasets by flexibly switching between strict and loose classification modes, thanks to the three-tier severity design.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/Precision_Recall.png","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3Guard/Precision_Recall.png\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### Multilingual Support\n\n","depth":3,"text":"Multilingual Support","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multilingual Support","text":"Multilingual Support","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3Guard supports **119 languages and dialects**, making it suitable for global deployments and cross-linguistic applications with consistent, high quality safety performance.","text":"Qwen3Guard supports **119 languages and dialects**, making it suitable for global deployments and cross-linguistic applications with consistent, high quality safety performance.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard supports ","text":"Qwen3Guard supports ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**119 languages and dialects**","text":"119 languages and dialects","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"119 languages and dialects","text":"119 languages and dialects","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", making it suitable for global deployments and cross-linguistic applications with consistent, high quality safety performance.","text":", making it suitable for global deployments and cross-linguistic applications with consistent, high quality safety performance.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{