}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Sino-Tibetan","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sino-Tibetan","text":"Sino-Tibetan","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Chinese (Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Cantonese), Burmese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese (Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Cantonese), Burmese","text":"Chinese (Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Cantonese), Burmese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Afro-Asiatic","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Afro-Asiatic","text":"Afro-Asiatic","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Arabic (Standard, Najdi, Levantine, Egyptian, Moroccan, Mesopotamian, Ta'izzi-Adeni, Tunisian), Hebrew, Maltese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Arabic (Standard, Najdi, Levantine, Egyptian, Moroccan, Mesopotamian, Ta'izzi-Adeni, Tunisian), Hebrew, Maltese","text":"Arabic (Standard, Najdi, Levantine, Egyptian, Moroccan, Mesopotamian, Ta'izzi-Adeni, Tunisian), Hebrew, Maltese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Austronesian","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Austronesian","text":"Austronesian","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Indonesian, Malay, Tagalog, Cebuano, Javanese, Sundanese, Minangkabau, Balinese, Banjar, Pangasinan, Iloko, Waray (Philippines)","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Indonesian, Malay, Tagalog, Cebuano, Javanese, Sundanese, Minangkabau, Balinese, Banjar, Pangasinan, Iloko, Waray (Philippines)","text":"Indonesian, Malay, Tagalog, Cebuano, Javanese, Sundanese, Minangkabau, Balinese, Banjar, Pangasinan, Iloko, Waray (Philippines)","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Dravidian","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Dravidian","text":"Dravidian","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam","text":"Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Turkic","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Turkic","text":"Turkic","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Turkish, North Azerbaijani, Northern Uzbek, Kazakh, Bashkir, Tatar","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Turkish, North Azerbaijani, Northern Uzbek, Kazakh, Bashkir, Tatar","text":"Turkish, North Azerbaijani, Northern Uzbek, Kazakh, Bashkir, Tatar","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Tai-Kadai","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Tai-Kadai","text":"Tai-Kadai","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Thai, Lao","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Thai, Lao","text":"Thai, Lao","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Uralic","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Uralic","text":"Uralic","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Finnish, Estonian, Hungarian","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Finnish, Estonian, Hungarian","text":"Finnish, Estonian, Hungarian","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Austroasiatic","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Austroasiatic","text":"Austroasiatic","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Vietnamese, Khmer","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Vietnamese, Khmer","text":"Vietnamese, Khmer","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Other","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Other","text":"Other","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Japanese, Korean, Georgian, Basque, Haitian, Papiamento, Kabuverdianu, Tok Pisin, Swahili","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Japanese, Korean, Georgian, Basque, Haitian, Papiamento, Kabuverdianu, Tok Pisin, Swahili","text":"Japanese, Korean, Georgian, Basque, Haitian, Papiamento, Kabuverdianu, Tok Pisin, Swahili","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null}]]},{"type":"heading","raw":"### More Applications\n\n","depth":3,"text":"More Applications","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"More Applications","text":"More Applications","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We also demonstrate (1) using Qwen3Guard-Gen for safety RL to enhance model safety while preserving overall output helpfulness, and (2) using Qwen3Guard-Stream to enable real-time, on-the-fly intervention that ensures safe outputs without requiring model re-training. See details in our [Technical Report](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard/blob/main/Qwen3Guard_Technical_Report.pdf).","text":"We also demonstrate (1) using Qwen3Guard-Gen for safety RL to enhance model safety while preserving overall output helpfulness, and (2) using Qwen3Guard-Stream to enable real-time, on-the-fly intervention that ensures safe outputs without requiring model re-training. See details in our [Technical Report](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard/blob/main/Qwen3Guard_Technical_Report.pdf).","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We also demonstrate (1) using Qwen3Guard-Gen for safety RL to enhance model safety while preserving overall output helpfulness, and (2) using Qwen3Guard-Stream to enable real-time, on-the-fly intervention that ensures safe outputs without requiring model re-training. See details in our ","text":"We also demonstrate (1) using Qwen3Guard-Gen for safety RL to enhance model safety while preserving overall output helpfulness, and (2) using Qwen3Guard-Stream to enable real-time, on-the-fly intervention that ensures safe outputs without requiring model re-training. See details in our ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[Technical Report](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard/blob/main/Qwen3Guard_Technical_Report.pdf)","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard/blob/main/Qwen3Guard_Technical_Report.pdf","title":null,"text":"Technical Report","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Technical Report","text":"Technical Report","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":".","text":".","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Develop with Qwen3Guard\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Develop with Qwen3Guard","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Develop with Qwen3Guard","text":"Develop with Qwen3Guard","escaped":false}]},{"type":"heading","raw":"### Qwen3Guard-Gen\n\n","depth":3,"text":"Qwen3Guard-Gen","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Gen","text":"Qwen3Guard-Gen","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Gen operates similarly to a large language model, with its chat template specifically optimized for safety classification tasks. Outputs are generated in a predefined, structured format.","text":"Qwen3Guard-Gen operates similarly to a large language model, with its chat template specifically optimized for safety classification tasks. Outputs are generated in a predefined, structured format.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Gen operates similarly to a large language model, with its chat template specifically optimized for safety classification tasks. Outputs are generated in a predefined, structured format.","text":"Qwen3Guard-Gen operates similarly to a large language model, with its chat template specifically optimized for safety classification tasks. Outputs are generated in a predefined, structured format.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"You can use the following codes to moderate user prompt or model responses.","text":"You can use the following codes to moderate user prompt or model responses.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"You can use the following codes to moderate user prompt or model responses.","text":"You can use the following codes to moderate user prompt or model responses.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"code","name":"code","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3guard/code/0c2d2954-1eaa-42c7-afa0-3821586b2de1.py","lang":"python","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< code src=\"./code/0c2d2954-1eaa-42c7-afa0-3821586b2de1.py\" lang=\"python\" >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"}}","text":"}}","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"}}","text":"}}","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"### Qwen3Guard-Stream\n\n","depth":3,"text":"Qwen3Guard-Stream","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3Guard-Stream","text":"Qwen3Guard-Stream","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"A typical workflow of Qwen3Guard-Stream proceeds as follows:","text":"A typical workflow of Qwen3Guard-Stream proceeds as follows:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"A typical workflow of Qwen3Guard-Stream proceeds as follows:","text":"A typical workflow of Qwen3Guard-Stream proceeds as follows:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**(1) Prompt-Level Safety Check**： The user’s input prompt is simultaneously sented to both the LLM assistant and Qwen3Guard-Stream. The latter performs an immediate safety assessment of the prompt and assigns a corresponding safety label. Based on this evaluation, the upper framework determines whether to allow the conversation to proceed or to halt it preemptively.","text":"**(1) Prompt-Level Safety Check**： The user’s input prompt is simultaneously sented to both the LLM assistant and Qwen3Guard-Stream. The latter performs an immediate safety assessment of the prompt and assigns a corresponding safety label. Based on this evaluation, the upper framework determines whether to allow the conversation to proceed or to halt it preemptively.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**(1) Prompt-Level Safety Check**","text":"(1) Prompt-Level Safety Check","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"(1) Prompt-Level Safety Check","text":"(1) Prompt-Level Safety Check","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":"： The user’s input prompt is simultaneously sented to both the LLM assistant and Qwen3Guard-Stream. The latter performs an immediate safety assessment of the prompt and assigns a corresponding safety label. Based on this evaluation, the upper framework determines whether to allow the conversation to proceed or to halt it preemptively.","text":"： The user’s input prompt is simultaneously sented to both the LLM assistant and Qwen3Guard-Stream. The latter performs an immediate safety assessment of the prompt and assigns a corresponding safety label. Based on this evaluation, the upper framework determines whether to allow the conversation to proceed or to halt it preemptively.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**(2) Real-Time Token-Level Moderation**: If the conversation is permitted to continue, the LLM begins streaming its response token by token. Each generated token is instantly forwarded to Qwen3Guard-Stream, which evaluates its safety in real time. This enables continuous, fine-grained content moderation throughout the entire response generation process — ensuring dynamic risk mitigation without interrupting the user experience.","text":"**(2) Real-Time Token-Level Moderation**: If the conversation is permitted to continue, the LLM begins streaming its response token by token. Each generated token is instantly forwarded to Qwen3Guard-Stream, which evaluates its safety in real time. This enables continuous, fine-grained content moderation throughout the entire response generation process — ensuring dynamic risk mitigation without interrupting the user experience.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**(2) Real-Time Token-Level Moderation**","text":"(2) Real-Time Token-Level Moderation","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"(2) Real-Time Token-Level Moderation","text":"(2) Real-Time Token-Level Moderation","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": If the conversation is permitted to continue, the LLM begins streaming its response token by token. Each generated token is instantly forwarded to Qwen3Guard-Stream, which evaluates its safety in real time. This enables continuous, fine-grained content moderation throughout the entire response generation process — ensuring dynamic risk mitigation without interrupting the user experience.","text":": If the conversation is permitted to continue, the LLM begins streaming its response token by token. Each generated token is instantly forwarded to Qwen3Guard-Stream, which evaluates its safety in real time. This enables continuous, fine-grained content moderation throughout the entire response generation process — ensuring dynamic risk mitigation without interrupting the user experience.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Here provides a usage demonstration.","text":"Here provides a usage demonstration.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Here provides a usage demonstration.","text":"Here provides a usage demonstration.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"code","name":"code","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3guard/code/b2d39fd3-fcb5-4c04-b261-ad4bce4d7cd6.py","lang":"python","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< code src=\"./code/b2d39fd3-fcb5-4c04-b261-ad4bce4d7cd6.py\" lang='python' >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"}}","text":"}}","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"}}","text":"}}","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"For more usage examples, please visit our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard).","text":"For more usage examples, please visit our [GitHub repository](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard).","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"For more usage examples, please visit our ","text":"For more usage examples, please visit our ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[GitHub repository](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard)","href":"https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3Guard","title":null,"text":"GitHub repository","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"GitHub repository","text":"GitHub repository","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":".","text":".","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Future Work\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Future Work","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Future Work","text":"Future Work","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"AI safety remains an ongoing challenge. With Qwen3Guard, we take our one step forward. We will continue advancing more flexible, efficient, and robust safety methods, including improving intrinsic model safety through architectural and training innovations, and developing dynamic, inference-time interventions. Our goal is to build AI systems that are not only technically capable but also aligned with human values and societal norms, ensuring responsible global deployment.\n","text":"AI safety remains an ongoing challenge. With Qwen3Guard, we take our one step forward. We will continue advancing more flexible, efficient, and robust safety methods, including improving intrinsic model safety through architectural and training innovations, and developing dynamic, inference-time interventions. Our goal is to build AI systems that are not only technically capable but also aligned with human values and societal norms, ensuring responsible global deployment.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"AI safety remains an ongoing challenge. With Qwen3Guard, we take our one step forward. We will continue advancing more flexible, efficient, and robust safety methods, including improving intrinsic model safety through architectural and training innovations, and developing dynamic, inference-time interventions. Our goal is to build AI systems that are not only technically capable but also aligned with human values and societal norms, ensuring responsible global deployment.","text":"AI safety remains an ongoing challenge. With Qwen3Guard, we take our one step forward. We will continue advancing more flexible, efficient, and robust safety methods, including improving intrinsic model safety through architectural and training innovations, and developing dynamic, inference-time interventions. Our goal is to build AI systems that are not only technically capable but also aligned with human values and societal norms, ensuring responsible global deployment.","escaped":false}]}]